<title>FINLAND: FINLAND BANK RESERVES FALL FIM 12 MLN IN WEEK.</title>
<headline>FINLAND BANK RESERVES FALL FIM 12 MLN IN WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Finland's latest</p>
<p>balance sheet for the week to September 30 showed the following</p>
<p>positions in millions of markka compared to September 23</p>
<p> Position			   Latest     Previous</p>
<p> Foreign reserves		 35,315	 35,327</p>
<p> Money market intervention    10,147	 13,541</p>
<p> Govt sector claims		5,998	  6,299</p>
<p> Corporate sector claims	 2,429	  2,432</p>
<p> Total assets		     61,928	 65,660</p>
<p>In the previous week, to September 23, reserves rose by 841</p>
<p>million markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-0-680 50 240</p>
</text>
